"y D<->+L) se amplía en este ejemplo."

#. type: Title ==
#: src/config/ini-homing.adoc:100
#, no-wrap
msgid "Homing Sequence"
msgstr "Secuencia de homing"

#. type: NOTE
#: src/config/ini-homing.adoc:105
msgid ""
"There are four possible homing sequences defined by the sign of "
"HOME_SEARCH_VEL and HOME_LATCH_VEL, along with the associated configuration "
"parameters as shown in the following table.  Two basic conditions exist, "
"HOME_SEARCH_VEL and HOME_LATCH_VEL are the same sign or they are opposite "
"signs.  For a more detailed description of what each configuration parameter "
"does, see the following section."
msgstr ""
"Hay cuatro posibles secuencias homing definidas por el signo de "
"HOME_SEARCH_VEL y HOME_LATCH_VEL, junto con los parámetros de configuración "
"asociados como se muestra en la siguiente tabla.  Existen dos condiciones "
"básicas, HOME_SEARCH_VEL y HOME_LATCH_VEL son del mismo signo o son signos "
"opuestos.  Para una descripción detallada de lo que hace cada parámetro de "
"configuración, ver la sección siguiente."

#. type: Positional ($1) AttributeList argument for macro 'image'
#: src/config/ini-homing.adoc:106 src/config/ini-homing.adoc:107
#, no-wrap
msgid "Homing Sequences"
msgstr "Secuencias homing"

#. type: Target for macro image
#: src/config/ini-homing.adoc:107
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "images/emc2-motion-homing-diag.png"
msgstr "images/emc2-motion-homing-diag.png"

#. type: NOTE
#: src/config/ini-homing.adoc:113
msgid ""
"The following determines exactly how the home sequence behaves.  They are "
"defined in an [JOINT_n] section of the INI file."
msgstr ""
"Lo siguiente determina exactamente cómo se comporta la secuencia homing.  Se "
"definen en una sección [JOINT_n] del archivo INI."

#. type: Table
#: src/config/ini-homing.adoc:116
#, no-wrap
msgid "Homing Type"
msgstr "Tipo de homing"

#. type: Title ===
#: src/config/ini-homing.adoc:116 src/config/ini-homing.adoc:126
#, no-wrap
msgid "HOME_SEARCH_VEL"
msgstr "HOME_SEARCH_VEL"

#. type: Title ===
#: src/config/ini-homing.adoc:116 src/config/ini-homing.adoc:144
#, no-wrap
msgid "HOME_LATCH_VEL"
msgstr "HOME_LATCH_VEL"

#. type: Title ===
#: src/config/ini-homing.adoc:117 src/config/ini-homing.adoc:178
#, no-wrap
msgid "HOME_USE_INDEX"
msgstr "HOME_USE_INDEX"

#. type: Table
#: src/config/ini-homing.adoc:117
#, no-wrap
msgid "Immediate"
msgstr "Inmediato"

#. type: Table
#: src/config/ini-homing.adoc:118 src/config/ini-homing.adoc:120
#, no-wrap
msgid "NO"
msgstr "NO"

#. type: Table
#: src/config/ini-homing.adoc:118
#, no-wrap
msgid "Index-only"
msgstr "Solo índice"

