#. type: Title ===
#: src/gcode/m-code.adoc:671
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "Selectively Restoring Modal State"
msgstr "Restauración selectiva del estado modal"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gcode/m-code.adoc:675
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Executing an 'M72' or returning from a subroutine which contains an 'M73' "
"will restore <<mcode:m70-saved-state,*all* modal state saved>>."
msgstr ""
"Ejecutar un 'M72' o regresar de una subrutina que contiene un 'M73' "
"restaurará <<mcode:m70-saved-state, *todo* estado modal guardado>>."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gcode/m-code.adoc:682
msgid ""
"If only some aspects of modal state should be preserved, an alternative is "
"the usage of <<gcode:predefined-named-parameters, predefined named "
"parameters>>, local parameters and conditional statements. The idea is to "
"remember the modes to be restored at the beginning of the subroutine, and "
"restore these before exiting. Here is an example, based on snippet of "
"'nc_files/tool-length-probe.ngc':"
msgstr ""
"Si solo se deben preservar algunos aspectos del estado modal, una "
"alternativa es el uso de <<gcode:predefined-named-parameters,parámetros con "
"nombre predefinido>>, parámetros locales y declaraciones condicionales. La "
"idea es recordar los modos que se restaurarán en el comienzo de la subrutina "
"y restaurar estos antes de salir. Aquí está un ejemplo, basado en el "
"fragmento de 'nc_files/tool-length-probe.ngc':"

#. type: delimited block -
#: src/gcode/m-code.adoc:700
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"O<measure> sub   (measure reference tool)\n"
";\n"
"#<absolute> = #<_absolute>  (remember in local variable if G90 was set)\n"
";\n"
"g30 (above switch)\n"
"g38.2 z0 f15 (measure)\n"
"g91 g0z.2 (off the switch)\n"
"#1000=#5063 (save reference tool length)\n"
"(print,reference length is #1000)\n"
";\n"
"O<restore_abs> if [#<absolute>]\n"
"    g90 (restore G90 only if it was set on entry:)\n"
"O<restore_abs> endif\n"
";\n"
"O<measure> endsub\n"
msgstr ""
"O<measure> sub (medida de herramienta de referencia)\n"
";\n"
"#<absolute>=#<_absolute> (recuerda en la variable local si se configuró G90)\n"
";\n"
"g30 (interruptor)\n"
"g38.2 z0 f15 (medida)\n"
"g91 g0z.2 (fuera del interruptor)\n"
"#1000=#5063 (guardar la longitud de la herramienta de referencia)\n"
"(print, la longitud de referencia es #1000)\n"
";\n"
"O<restore_abs> if [#<absolute>]\n"
"    g90 (restaurar G90 solo si se configuró en la entrada:)\n"
"O<restore_abs> endif\n"
";\n"
"O<measure> endsub\n"

