msgstr "¿Qué es GladeVCP?"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/gladevcp.adoc:25
msgid ""
"GladeVCP is a LinuxCNC component which adds the ability to add a new user "
"interface panel to LinuxCNC user interfaces like:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: src/gui/gladevcp.adoc:29 src/gui/gscreen.adoc:5 src/user/user-intro.adoc:114
