#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/gscreen.adoc:247
msgid ""
"It assumes the power button is called 'button_machine_on' and the F2 key "
"controls it."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/gscreen.adoc:250
msgid ""
"These are easily fixed by renaming the buttons in the Glade editor to "
"match.  But instead we are going to override the standard calls and add our "
"own."
