#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1136
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Ubuntu/Mint does not follow the standard so you can't set how long the message stays up for.\n"
"I suggest fixing this with the `notify-osd` package available from https://launchpad.net/~leolik/+archive/leolik?field.series_filter=lucid[this PPA] (DISCONTINUED due to move of Ubuntu to Gnome)."
