msgstr "images/qtvcp_tester.png"

#. type: Title ====
#: src/gui/qtvcp-widgets.adoc:1472
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "Formatting MDI Command"
msgstr "Comandos en la terminal [[sec:Terminal-Commands]](((Terminal Commands)))"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-widgets.adoc:1474
msgid ""
"The widget supports a formatting option which is passed to Python's string "
"`format()` to produce the final output for the MDI command.  The special "
"token `{value}` can be inserted anywhere in this format string where the "
"value should appear.  The formatting property is called "
"`mdi_command_format_option`, e.g.:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-widgets.adoc:1476
msgid ""
"`M3 S{value}` to start the spindle at the speed entered by the operator."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-widgets.adoc:1477
msgid ""
"`M6 T{value} G43 H{value}` to issue a tool change and tool length offset "
"change from the tool number entered"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ====
#: src/gui/qtvcp-widgets.adoc:1478
#, no-wrap
msgid "Automatic vs Deferred MDI Issue"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-widgets.adoc:1480
msgid ""
"The widget may be configured to automatically issue the MDI command upon "
"submit when `issue_mdi_on_submit_option` is set to `True`. If `False` "
"issuing the command may be done at a later time via a signal or function "
"call from another widget."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-widgets.adoc:1482
msgid ""
"In cases where `issue_mdi_on_submit_option` is `False`, calling the "
"`issue_mdi()` function will issue the command.  Slots attached to widgets "
"such as PushButtons can trigger the MDI command when pressed, e.g.:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: src/gui/qtvcp-widgets.adoc:1487
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    def setSpindleSpeed(self, event):\n"
"        self.w.lineSpindleSpeed.issue_mdi()\n"
"        ACTION.SET_MANUAL_MODE()\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: src/gui/qtvcp-widgets.adoc:1491
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    def setToolNumber(self, event):\n"
"        self.w.lineToolNumber.issue_mdi()\n"
"        ACTION.SET_MANUAL_MODE()\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ====
#: src/gui/qtvcp-widgets.adoc:1493
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pending State Styling Example"
msgstr "Ejemplo de estilo de estado pendiente"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-widgets.adoc:1496
msgid ""
"The widget tracks whether a value entered is pending and has not yet been "
"issued via the property `isPendingValue`.  This may be used to style the "
"widget via the stylesheet.  This can be used to alert the operator that they "
"entered a value but another action must be taken to apply it."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-widgets.adoc:1498
msgid ""
"The following style sheet excerpt will highlight the entry widget with a "
"cyan background when values are pending and have not been applied."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: src/gui/qtvcp-widgets.adoc:1504
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"#lineSpindleSpeed[isPendingValue=true],\n"
"#lineToolNumber[isPendingValue=true] {\n"
"    background: cyan;\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: src/gui/qtvcp-widgets.adoc:1509
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"#lineSpindleSpeed[isPendingValue=false],\n"
"#lineToolNumber[isPendingValue=false] {\n"
"    background: none;\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

