"later. In version 2.5.0, the graphical interface interface does not allow "
"these adjustments."

#. type: Positional ($1) AttributeList argument for macro 'image'
#: src/gui/tooledit.adoc:19 src/gui/tooledit.adoc:20
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
