#: src/gui/vismach.adoc:250
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`part = Color([colorspec], [part])`\n"
"Sets the display color of the part. Note that unlike the other functions the part definition comes second in this case.\n"
"The colorspec consists of the three RGB values and an opacity. For example [1,0,0,0.5] for a 50% opacity red."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/vismach.adoc:253
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`myhud = Hud()`\n"
"Creates a heads-up display in the Vismach GUI to display such items as axis positions."
msgstr ""

