#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "Logic Examples"
msgstr "Ejemplos de fresado"

#. type: Index entry
#: src/hal/basic-hal.adoc:516
#, fuzzy
msgid "HAL Logic Examples"
msgstr "Ejemplo HAL"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/hal/basic-hal.adoc:516
#, fuzzy
msgid ".Example using `and2`"
msgstr "Ejemplos"

#. type: delimited block -
#: src/hal/basic-hal.adoc:523
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"loadrt and2 count=1\n"
"addf and2.0 servo-thread\n"
"net my-sigin1 and2.0.in0 <= parport.0.pin-11-in\n"
"net my-sigin2 and2.0.in1 <= parport.0.pin-12-in\n"
"net both-on parport.0.pin-14-out <= and2.0.out\n"
msgstr ""
"loadrt or2\n"
"addf or2.0 servo-thread\n"
"net button-1 or2.0.in0 <= pyvcp.button-1\n"
"net button-2 or2.0.in1 <= pyvcp.button-2\n"
"net led-1 pyvcp.led-1 <= or2.0.out\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/hal/basic-hal.adoc:530
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In the above example one copy of `and2` is loaded into real time space and "
"added to the servo thread.  Next `pin-11` of the parallel port is connected "
"to the `in0` bit of the and gate.  Next `pin-12` is connected to the `in1` "
"bit of the and gate.  Last we connect the `and2` out bit to the parallel "
"port `pin-14`.  So following the truth table for `and2` if pin 11 and pin 12 "
"are on then the output pin 14 will be on."
msgstr ""
"En el ejemplo anterior, se carga una sola copia (count=1) de and2 en el "
"espacio de tiempo real y se agrega (addf) al hilo servo. Despues, el pin 11 "
"del puerto paralelo es conectado al bit 0 de la puerta and2.0 y el pin 12 se "
"conecta al bit 1 de la puerta and2.0. Por último, se conecta el bit de "
"salida del componente (and2.0.out)  al pin 14 del puerto paralelo. Para ello "
"se crea y usa la señal both-on. Entonces, siguiendo la tabla de verdad para "
"and2, si el pin 11 y el pin 12 están encendidos, el pin de salida 14 estará "
"encendido."

