#. type: Plain text
#: src/ladder/classic-ladder.adoc:281
msgid "A short description of each of the buttons:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/ladder/classic-ladder.adoc:283
msgid ""
"'Selector' - allows you to select existing objects and modify the "
"information."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/ladder/classic-ladder.adoc:284
msgid "'Eraser' - erases an object."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/ladder/classic-ladder.adoc:287
msgid ""
"'N.O. Contact' - creates a normally open contact. It can be an external HAL-"
"pin (%I) input contact, an internal-bit coil (%B) contact or a external coil "
"(%Q) contact.  The HAL-pin input contact is closed when the HAL-pin is "
"true.  The coil contacts are closed when the corresponding coil is active "
"(%Q2 contact closes when %Q2 coil is active)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/ladder/classic-ladder.adoc:288
msgid ""
"'N.C. Contact' - creates a normally closed contact. It is the same as the "
"N.O. contact except that the contact is open when the HAL-pin is true or the "
"coil is active."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/ladder/classic-ladder.adoc:289
msgid ""
"'Rising Edge Contact' - creates a contact that is closed when the HAL-pin "
"goes from False to true, or the coil from not-active to active."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/ladder/classic-ladder.adoc:290
msgid ""
"'Falling Edge Contact' - creates a contact that is closed when the HAL-pin "
"goes from true to false or the coil from active to not."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/ladder/classic-ladder.adoc:291
msgid "'Horizontal Connection' - creates a horizontal connection to objects."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/ladder/classic-ladder.adoc:292
msgid ""
"'Vertical Connection' - creates a vertical connection to horizontal lines."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/ladder/classic-ladder.adoc:293
msgid ""
"'Horizontal Running Connection' - creates a horizontal connection between "
"two objects and is a quick way to connect objects that are more than one "
"block apart."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/ladder/classic-ladder.adoc:294
msgid "'IEC Timer' - creates a timer and replaces the 'Timer'."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/ladder/classic-ladder.adoc:295
msgid "'Timer' - creates a Timer Module (depreciated use IEC Timer instead)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/ladder/classic-ladder.adoc:296
msgid "'Monostable' - creates a one-shot monostable module"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/ladder/classic-ladder.adoc:297
msgid "'Counter' - creates a counter module."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/ladder/classic-ladder.adoc:299
msgid ""
"'Compare' - creates a compare block to compare variable to values or other "
"variables, e.g. `%W1<=5` or `%W1=%W2`.  Compare cannot be placed in the "
"right most side of the section display."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/ladder/classic-ladder.adoc:301
msgid ""
"'Variable Assignment' - creates an assignment block so you to assign values "
"to variables, e.g. `%W2=7` or `%W1=%W2`.  ASSIGNMENT functions can only be "
"placed at the right most side of the section display."
msgstr ""

