#. type: Title ===
#: src/ladder/classic-ladder.adoc:421
#, no-wrap
msgid "COMPARE"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/ladder/classic-ladder.adoc:424
msgid ""
"For arithmetic comparison. Is variable %XXX = to this number (or evaluated "
"number)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/ladder/classic-ladder.adoc:426
msgid ""
"The compare block will be true when comparison is true. You can use most "
"math symbols:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/ladder/classic-ladder.adoc:428
msgid "`+`, `-`, `*`, `/`, `=` (standard math symbols)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/ladder/classic-ladder.adoc:429
msgid ""
"`<` (less than), `>` (greater than), `<=` (less or equal), `>=` (greater or "
"equal), `<>` (not equal)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/ladder/classic-ladder.adoc:431
msgid ""
"`(`, `)` separate into groups example `%IF1=2,&%IF2<5` in pseudo code "
"translates to if %IF1 is equal to 2 and %IF2 is less than 5 then the "
"comparison is true.  Note the comma separating the two groups of comparisons."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/ladder/classic-ladder.adoc:432
msgid "`^` (exponent), `%` (modulus), `&` (and), `|` (or),. -"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/ladder/classic-ladder.adoc:433
msgid "`ABS` (absolute), `MOY` (French for average), `AVG` (average)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/ladder/classic-ladder.adoc:435
msgid "For example ABS(%W2)=1, MOY(%W1,%W2)<3."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/ladder/classic-ladder.adoc:438
msgid ""
"No spaces are allowed in the comparison equation.  For example `%C0.V>%C0.P` "
"is a valid comparison expression while `%C0.V > %CO.P` is not a valid "
"expression."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/ladder/classic-ladder.adoc:441
msgid ""
"There is a list of Variables down the page that can be used for reading from "
"and writing to ladder objects.  When a new compare block is opened be sure "
"and delete the `#` symbol when you enter a compare."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/ladder/classic-ladder.adoc:443
msgid ""
"To find out if word variable #1 is less than 2 times the current value of "
"counter #0 the syntax would be:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: src/ladder/classic-ladder.adoc:446
#, no-wrap
msgid "%W1<2*%C0.V\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/ladder/classic-ladder.adoc:449
msgid "To find out if S32in bit 2 is equal to 10 the syntax would be:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: src/ladder/classic-ladder.adoc:452
#, no-wrap
msgid "%IW2=10\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/ladder/classic-ladder.adoc:455
msgid ""
"Note: Compare uses the arithmetic equals not the double equals that "
"programmers are used to."
msgstr ""

