"When personalities are used in a comp file, HAL instances are exported "
"sequentially (typically by the mutually exclusive count= or names= "
"parameters). If the number of exports exceeds the maximum number of "
"personalities, subsequent personalities are assigned modulo the maximum "
"number of personalities allowed."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/man/man1/halcompile.1.adoc:33
msgid ""
"By default, the maximum number of personalities is 64. To alter this limit, "
"use the *--personalities=* option with halcompile. For example, to set the "
"maximum of personality items to 4: [sudo] *halcompile --personalities=4* --"
"install ..."
msgstr ""
"De forma predeterminada, el número máximo de personalidades es 64. Para "
"alterar este límite, use la opción *--personalities=* con halcompile. Por "
"ejemplo, para establecer un máximo de 4 elementos de personalidad: [sudo] "
"*halcompile --personalities=4* --install ..."

