msgid "*halui.max-velocity.scale* float in"
msgstr "`spindleoverride(float [, int])`"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/man/man1/halui.1.adoc:211
msgid ""
"This pin controls the scale of changes to the max velocity. Each unit change "
"in .counts, and each positive edge on .increase and .decrease, changes the "
"max velocity by .scale. The units of the .scale pin are machine-units per "
"second."
