"available UARTs are printed to standard output during the driver loading "
"process and take the form: hm2___<board name>__.__<board "
"index>__.uart.__<index>__, for example `hm2_5i23.0.uart.0`.  The minimum "
"bitrate is approximately 50 bps, and the maximum around the FPGA frequency, "
"48 MHz for a 5I23.  The UART function allows different RX and TX bitrates, "
"but that is not currently supported by this driver."
