"useful for spindle position sensing and maybe other things. Instead of using "
"a real encoder that outputs quadrature, some lathes have a sensor that "
"generates a simple pulse stream as the spindle turns and an index pulse once "
"per revolution. This component simply counts up when a \"count\" pulse "
"(phase-A) is received, and if reset is enabled, resets when the \"index\" "
"(phase-Z) pulse is received."
