msgstr "**encoder**.__N__.**missing-teeth** s32 in"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/man/man9/encoder.9.adoc:101
msgid ""
"The number of teeth missing from the index gap. For example a 60 tooth gear "
"with two teeth shortened to form an index so that there are 58 pulses per "
"revolution would use a position-scale of 60 and a missing-teeth of 2."
