msgid ""
"The maximum SPI clock of the BCM2835-SPI driver and the 7i90 is documented "
"over 32&#8239;MHz. The SPI driver can provide frequencies well beyond what "
"is acceptable for the 7i90. A safe value to start with would be "
"12.5&#8239;MHz (spiclk_rate=12500) and then work your way up from there."
