"frequency is 250&#8239;MHz and the divider for SPI0/SPI1 scales using "
"discrete factors. The following list specifies the *spiclk_rate* setting and "
"the discrete SPI clock frequency (250&#8239;MHz / (2__n__) for _n_ > 1):"
