#. type: Plain text
#: src/man/man9/hm2_spi.9.adoc:27
msgid ""
"hm2_spi is a device driver that interfaces Mesa's SPI based Anything I/O "
"boards (with the HostMot2 firmware) to the LinuxCNC HAL."
