#. type: Plain text
#: src/man/man9/hm2_spi.9.adoc:41
msgid ""
"It is possible for one SPI bus to connect several devices; in this "
"configuration, a master device has several chip select lines. In order to "
"meet realtime deadlines, hm2_spi should be used on a dedicated SPI interface "
"not shared with any other slaves."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: src/man/man9/hm2_spi.9.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
