"the center of the belt/smooth rod/extrusion that the joints ride on. In "
"RepRap delta parlance, R is DELTA_RADIUS which is computed as"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/man/man9/lineardeltakins.9.adoc:33
