#. type: Plain text
#: src/man/man9/sampler.9.adoc:71
msgid ""
"A number that identifies the sample. It is automatically incremented for "
"each sample, and can be reset using the *setp* command. The sample number "
"can optionally be printed in the first column of the output from "
"*halsampler*, using the _-t_ option (see *man 1 halsampler* )."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/man/man9/sampler.9.adoc:75
