#. type: Block title
#: src/remap/remap.adoc:430
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "Simple example for named parameter passing to a Python function"
msgstr "Ejemplo simple para pasar un parámetro con nombre a una función de Python"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/remap/remap.adoc:434
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"It's possible to define new codes _without_ any NGC procedure.  Here's a "
"simple first example, a more complex one can be found in the next section."
msgstr ""
"Es posible definir nuevos códigos 'sin' procedimiento NGC. Esto es un primer "
"ejemplo simple; uno más complejo se puede encontrar en la siguiente sección."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/remap/remap.adoc:438
#, fuzzy
msgid "`REMAP=G88.6 modalgroup=1 argspec=XYZp python=g886`"
msgstr "`REMAP=G88.6 modalgroup=1 argspec=XYZp python=g886`"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/remap/remap.adoc:440
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This instructs the interpreter to execute the Python function `g886` in the "
"`module_basename.remap` module, which might look like so:"
msgstr ""
"Esto le indica al intérprete que ejecute la función Python `g886` en el "
"modulo `module_basename.remap`, que podría ser así:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: src/remap/remap.adoc:445
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"from interpreter import INTERP_OK\n"
"from emccanon import MESSAGE\n"
msgstr ""
"from interpreter import INTERP_OK\n"
"from emccanon import MESSAGE\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: src/remap/remap.adoc:453
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"def g886(self, **words):\n"
"    for key in words:\n"
"        MESSAGE(\"word '%s' = %f\" % (key, words[key]))\n"
"    if words.has_key('p'):\n"
"        MESSAGE(\"the P word was present\")\n"
"    MESSAGE(\"comment on this line: '%s'\" % (self.blocks[self.remap_level].comment))\n"
"    return INTERP_OK\n"
msgstr ""
"def g886(self, **words):\n"
"    for key in words:\n"
"        MESSAGE(\"word '%s' = %f\" % (key, words[key]))\n"
"    if words.has_key('p'):\n"
"        MESSAGE(\"la palabra P estaba presente\")\n"
"    MESSAGE(\"comentario en esta línea: '%s'\" % (self.blocks[self.remap_level].comment))\n"
"    return INTERP_OK\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/remap/remap.adoc:458
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Try this with out with:\n"
"  g88.6 x1 y2 z3\n"
"  g88.6 x1 y2 z3 p33 (a comment here)\n"
msgstr ""
"Pruebe esto con:\n"
"  g88.6 x1 y2 z3\n"
"  g88.6 x1 y2 z3 p33 (un comentario aquí)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/remap/remap.adoc:462
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You'll notice the gradual introduction of the embedded Python environment - "
