msgid ""
"This component can be used as a part of a simple software ESTOP chain\\&."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/estop_latch.9:40
msgid "It has two states: \"OK\" and \"Faulted\"\\&."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/estop_latch.9:42
msgid ""
"The initial state is \"Faulted\"\\&. When faulted, the B<out-ok> output is "
"false, the B<fault-out> output is true, and the B<watchdog> output is "
"unchanging\\&."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/estop_latch.9:44
msgid ""
"The state changes from \"Faulted\" to \"OK\" when B<all> these conditions "
"are true:"
